1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;1. Choisit dates et chambres&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;reservation.astro · GET /api/public/availability&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1c2420;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;fillColor=#f6ead9;strokeColor=#9a5b13;opacity=100;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="130" width="260" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a2" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;2. Se connecte&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;email + mot de passe ou Google · websiteAuth.service&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1c2420;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;fillColor=#f6ead9;strokeColor=#9a5b13;opacity=100;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="240" width="260" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a3" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;3. submit()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;demande PENDING · email en file · push au personnel&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1c2420;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;fillColor=#e1ece8;strokeColor=#164d43;opacity=100;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="360" y="350" width="260" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a4" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;4. Examine la demande&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;WebsiteRequests.tsx · accepte ou refuse (reject)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1c2420;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;fillColor=#e2eaf4;strokeColor=#2f5a8c;opacity=100;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="460" width="260" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a5" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;5. approve()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;verrou chambres · réservation AWAITING · demande AWAITING_PAYMENT · instructions MVola&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1c2420;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;fillColor=#e1ece8;strokeColor=#164d43;opacity=100;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="360" y="570" width="260" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a6" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;6. Paie par MVola, envoie la preuve&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;POST …/proofs · websiteProof.service&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1c2420;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;fillColor=#f6ead9;strokeColor=#9a5b13;opacity=100;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="680" width="260" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a7" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;7. Encaisse l’acompte&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;receiveDeposit() : facture d’acompte créée, visée, payée&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1c2420;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;fillColor=#e2eaf4;strokeColor=#2f5a8c;opacity=100;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="660" y="790" width="260" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a8" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;8. confirm()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;acompte complet ? → réservation CONFIRMED, demande CONFIRMED&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1c2420;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;fillColor=#e1ece8;strokeColor=#164d43;opacity=100;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="360" y="900" width="260" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n1" value="&lt;b&gt;Planificateur (chaque minute)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;expireRequests() : délai dépassé → expirée&lt;br&gt;processOutbox() : envoi des emails" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1c2420;fillColor=#fff8db;strokeColor=#c9b458;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="360" y="1000" width="260" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4Parcoursdemandedusite-e1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5d6862;fontSize=11;fontColor=#3b4540;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a1" target="a2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4Parcoursdemandedusite-e2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5d6862;fontSize=11;fontColor=#3b4540;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a2" target="a3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4Parcoursdemandedusite-e3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5d6862;fontSize=11;fontColor=#3b4540;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a3" target="a4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4Parcoursdemandedusite-e4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5d6862;fontSize=11;fontColor=#3b4540;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a4" target="a5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4Parcoursdemandedusite-e5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5d6862;fontSize=11;fontColor=#3b4540;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a5" target="a6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4Parcoursdemandedusite-e6" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5d6862;fontSize=11;fontColor=#3b4540;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a6" target="a7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4Parcoursdemandedusite-e7" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5d6862;fontSize=11;fontColor=#3b4540;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a7" target="a8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="p5" name="5. Statuts d’une réservation"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1169" pageHeight="827" background="#ffffff" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="t" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;Statuts d’une réservation (Booking.status)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#5d6862&quot;&gt;Chemin normal et règles principales. Changements via PATCH /api/bookings/:id/status → booking.service.ts updateStatus().&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1c2420;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1000" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="aw" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;AWAITING&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;En attente d’acompte (demande du site acceptée)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1c2420;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;fillColor=#f6ead9;strokeColor=#9a5b13;arcSize=30;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="120" width="210" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cf" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;CONFIRMED&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Réservation confirmée&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1c2420;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;fillColor=#e1ece8;strokeColor=#164d43;arcSize=30;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="120" width="210" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ci" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;CHECKED_IN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;En séjour&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1c2420;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;fillColor=#e1ece8;strokeColor=#164d43;arcSize=30;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="120" width="210" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cu" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;CHECKED_OUT_UNPAID&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Parti, facture non soldée&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1c2420;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;fillColor=#e2eaf4;strokeColor=#2f5a8c;arcSize=30;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="330" width="210" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cp" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;CHECKED_OUT_PAID&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Parti, facture soldée&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1c2420;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;fillColor=#e2eaf4;strokeColor=#2f5a8c;arcSize=30;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="910" y="330" width="210" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cl" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;CLOSED&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Clôturée, définitif&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1c2420;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;fillColor=#ece4f3;strokeColor=#6b4a8a;arcSize=30;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="910" y="540" width="210" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ca" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;CANCELLED&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Annulée&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1c2420;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;fillColor=#f1f1f1;strokeColor=#8a8a8a;arcSize=30;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="330" width="210" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5Statutsdunerservation-e1" value="confirm() · acompte reçu" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5d6862;fontSize=11;fontColor=#3b4540;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="aw" target="cf"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5Statutsdunerservation-e2" value="check-in" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5d6862;fontSize=11;fontColor=#3b4540;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="cf" target="ci"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5Statutsdunerservation-e3" value="check-out, impayé&lt;br&gt;(manager / admin)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5d6862;fontSize=11;fontColor=#3b4540;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ci" target="cu"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5Statutsdunerservation-e4" value="check-out, payé" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5d6862;fontSize=11;fontColor=#3b4540;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ci" target="cp"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5Statutsdunerservation-e5" value="paiement reçu&lt;br&gt;(resync auto)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5d6862;fontSize=11;fontColor=#3b4540;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;entryX=0;entryY=0.3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="cu" target="cp"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5Statutsdunerservation-e6" value="paiement annulé" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5d6862;fontSize=11;fontColor=#3b4540;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0;exitY=0.7;entryX=1;entryY=0.7;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="cp" target="cu"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5Statutsdunerservation-e7" value="clôture&lt;br&gt;(bookings.close)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5d6862;fontSize=11;fontColor=#3b4540;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="cp" target="cl"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5Statutsdunerservation-e8" value="annulation" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5d6862;fontSize=11;fontColor=#3b4540;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="aw" target="ca"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5Statutsdunerservation-e9" value="annulation" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5d6862;fontSize=11;fontColor=#3b4540;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="cf" target="ca"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5Statutsdunerservation-e10" value="annuler l’annulation&lt;br&gt;(re-vérifie les chambres)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#5d6862;fontSize=11;fontColor=#3b4540;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.75;exitY=0;entryX=0.75;entryY=1;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ca" target="cf"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n1" value="&lt;b&gt;À retenir&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Au check-out, la facture est visée automatiquement, et le statut devient UNPAID ou PAID selon ce qui a été payé.&lt;br&gt;• CHECKED_OUT (ancien) n’est plus jamais écrit : conservé pour l’historique.&lt;br&gt;• Une réservation liée à une demande du site en AWAITING_PAYMENT ne peut que rester AWAITING ou être annulée.&lt;br&gt;• Statut affiché ≠ statut stocké : computeEffectiveStatus() calcule upcoming, due_checkin, in_progress, overdue… (client/src/lib/bookingStatus.ts).&lt;br&gt;• Liste des statuts où la chambre est libérée : TERMINAL_STATUSES (server/src/lib/bookingStatus.ts)." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1c2420;fillColor=#fff8db;strokeColor=#c9b458;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="520" width="760" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
